    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like it wasn't nothing though. it feels like i just burned myself out for a result i couldn't even control. everything feels empty now. i just look at my life and i see a void. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i can finally stop fighting. i just want it all to go quiet.",
