      "content": "\"let the quiet come\"... that sounds so much better than this. i honestly think about it all the time now. just sleeping and not having to wake up to this heavy feeling again. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace. do you think i'm just being dramatic, or is it normal to feel like giving up is the only logical thing left?",
